Tests: uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario" -> 11204 passed, 334 skipped, 8 deselected
Live check (local dev server): /domain/pages/list?include_domains=true
15.4 s cold -> 0.69 s cached; /health and /navbar/state answer in 3-6 ms
while a cold Domains fetch is in flight (previously blocked for its full
